  "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-02.htm",
   "quest": 454,
   "text": "Injured Soldier: You! This land, it's so chaotic, so much death. I feel like I'm trapped in a nightmare. I just have to calm down. I need to calm down. Can you leave me alone a while? (This quest can be taken once a day and resets at 6:30am.)",
   "header": "Injured Soldier",
   "when": [
    "state COMPLETED; !qs.isNowAvailable()"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01.htm",
   "quest": 454,
   "text": "Injured Soldier: The last thing I remember is jumping from a sinking airship. Then as I was about to be attacked by the monsters of the Seed, I blanked out. I can only remember bits and pieces of what happened, and it's all so terrifying. When I regained consciousness, I was here. I... don't want t…",
   "header": "Injured Soldier",
   "when": [
    "state COMPLETED|CREATED; level >= 84; quest_escort == 0"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Of course.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00454_CompletelyLost 32738-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00454_CompletelyLost",
     "event": "32738-04.htm",
     "quest": 454,
     "to": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-04.htm",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-04.htm",
      "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-04a.htm",
      "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01b.htm"
     ],
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01c.htm": {
   "file": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01c.htm",
   "quest": 454,
   "text": "Injured Soldier: I fight to stay alive, anything I can if it means getting out of here! I really need to concentrate on that. (Another character is already in progress of this quest.)",
   "header": "Injured Soldier",
   "when": [
    "state COMPLETED|CREATED; level >= 84; !quest_escort == 0; quest_escort == 99"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01a.htm": {
   "file": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-01a.htm",
   "quest": 454,
   "text": "Injured Soldier: I have agreed to follow %leader%. He has promised to take me to a safe place. %name% is also in the same group as %leader%, so you will help to bring me to a safe place, right?",
   "header": "Injured Soldier",
   "when": [
    "state COMPLETED|CREATED; level >= 84; !quest_escort == 0; !quest_escort == 99; leader.isInParty(); leader.getParty().containsPlayer(player)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Accept.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00454_CompletelyLost 32738-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00454_CompletelyLost",
     "event": "32738-04.htm",
