  "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-04a.htm": {
   "file": "Q00454_CompletelyLost/32738-04a.htm",
   "quest": 454,
   "text": "Injured Soldier: Th, thank you. Then, if General Ermian is there, it should be a safe place. But it would be best if it doesn't take too long. As you can see, I'm wounded... If %leader%'s preparations are complete, please tell me that you are ready to depart.",
